          </div>
          <div class="select-creator-sub">${applicant.school || '高校认证'} · 申请时间：${applicant.appliedAt || '1天前'}</div>
          <p class="select-creator-proposal"><strong>竞标思路：</strong>${applicant.proposal || '具备完整商业交付经验，可严格按时保质交付。'}</p>
